+    Returns the input unchanged when the shape does not clearly match, because
+    a wrong peel silently changes what an interest IS, which is worse than a
+    slightly noisy card.
+    """
+    s = (subject or "").strip()
+    m = _PUBLISHER_TAIL_RE.match(s)
